Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.40,1:20:30.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《金蝉脱壳3：恶魔车站》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这时候得动点想象力 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you gotta use your imagination here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要只看表面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't judge a book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾是西屋家电制造厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be Westinghouse Appliance Manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幢楼占地十四英亩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sits on a 14-acre lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,单是这层就有两万平方英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}This floor alone, 20, 000 square feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说俄亥俄州吧 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Ohio, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿产出过最多的宇航员和最多的总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most astronauts and most presidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为到目前为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think 25 astronauts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有25位宇航员和8位总统了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eight presidents so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,张小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Zhang, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你的爸爸会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think your father would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我喜欢这儿 鲍\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I like it here, Bao.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两幢楼我都喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like both buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车制造商 钢铁厂 电器厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car manufacturers, steel mills, electrical appliances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人们失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}People here lost it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是真的想找到工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really wanna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从他们眼里就能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see it in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是一项很好的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is a really good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稍等 达雅 - 爸爸 请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, Daya. - Dad, please trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雅 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daya, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙特阿拉伯人知道我们把这个盖在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The royal family knows we built this in the hull of a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子问我们可不可以把它盖在沙子底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They asked if we could build one under the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,120亿 先付一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve billion. Half in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 在中国境外开设工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, opening plants outside of China.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能达不到国内这样的水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}may not play so well here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是给美国带来就业机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But bringing jobs into America.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,能提升我们的国际知名度\N{\fnArial\fs30}will help our worldwide brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是一项很好的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be a good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方共赢 我真的很想促成这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both sides win. I really want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就是25位宇航员和8位总统吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, 25 astronauts and eight presidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国潮要来登陆曼斯菲尔德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}China's coming to Mansfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴张氏科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so glad Zhang Innovations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在考虑对曼斯菲尔德投资\N{\fnArial\fs30}is considering Mansfield for investment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.41,0:04:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会倾其所能地促成这笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are gonna do whatever it takes to get that deal done for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 市长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对目前的现状非常满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were very pleased with everything that we saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定会再联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll definitely be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我期待着你的回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. I look forward to your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一路顺风 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And safe travels. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,张小姐 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Ms. Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的贴身保镖一刻不离 紧盯着你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bodyguard never relaxes. He doesn't take his eyes off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他接替了罗沈 已经很好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is difficult to fill the shoes of Shen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲讨厌罗沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father hated Shen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,沈根本没错 他只是喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen did nothing wrong but love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷·布雷斯林）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在七楼有个漂亮的接待员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventh floor, there's a pretty receptionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:41.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚州 洛杉矶）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能撩上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can charm your way through her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以完全避开安保\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can avoid security altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 我在想你之前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Abigail, I was thinking about what you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一起同居的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}about us moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得想法挺好 不过还有一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think it's a pretty good idea, except for one small thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫作 打鼾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's called "snoring."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊 乱讲 我可不打鼾\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Get out of here! I don't snore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你 我就不知道是谁打的鼾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it ain't you, I don't know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我也可以塞点东西 弄个木塞之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I could put something, maybe a cork or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会让你稍微消停点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it'll keep you a little more quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 雷 我们谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ray, we gotta focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拿到那个磁盘 并确保要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get that disk and make sure our names aren't tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你前搭档的黑狱活动撇清关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your ex-partner's black site activity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才能可以睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we sleep better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡个好觉 我能美美地醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I sleep better, I wake up happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我心情美滋滋的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I'm sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以在床上享受端来的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll get breakfast in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 阿比盖尔 就这么说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Abigail, that's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问周先生在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chow, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以问一下你找他有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I tell him what this is regarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是个惊喜 - 他并不喜欢惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a surprise. - He's not big on surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么 - 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name? Friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了一位叫朋友的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Friend is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 朋友先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国人 带着公文包和雨伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese, with a briefcase and an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 没在下雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, not raining. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上就来 朋友先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right with you, Mr. Friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也需要它 - 把磁盘给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want it too. - Give me the disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的 雷·布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me, Ray Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗沈 - 我们来看看磁盘里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shen Lo. - We're gonna see what's on that disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我满意了 就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm satisfied, then you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄州 曼斯菲尔德）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 这些人都是专业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, these guys were professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们能在这点上达成一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can agree on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们掌握了你们的时间表\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew your timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们掌握了你们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew where you were gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道她什么时候离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew when she was leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道什么时候在机库蹲守\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew when to be at the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实话跟你说 我们毫无线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be honest with you. We've got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的护卫任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在负责她的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were responsible for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就像我之前说的 我们进了城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, as I told him, we came into town…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 是啊 我们都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, we've heard all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们进了城 在四处物色房地产\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in town, you're looking at real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的就是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有注意到什么不一样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anything different?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么你觉得突出的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there something that stood out to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 想一想 从头开始想\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just think about it, from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最初看到的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the first thing you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得的第一件事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the first thing you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有你能告诉我们的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something you can tell us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些发生了的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一幸存的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only person that's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总不能去问这些死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly can't ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在负责她的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were responsible for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who took her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你怎么会不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - You have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓用生命保护她的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are supposed to protect my daughter with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她被绑架了 而你还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you did your job right, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了 我被打晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried. I was knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 带他离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Whoa! Get him outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 够了 - 她人呢 她人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's enough, that's enough! - Where is she? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他带出去 把他带出去 - 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him outta here! Get him outta here! - Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your hands off me! Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下吧 我还没审完你呢 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a seat. I'm not done with you. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个磁盘没问题 你就可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that disk is clear, you can be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我难道应该还要谢谢你放我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to say thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是罗沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Shen Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 很高兴见到你 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Very nice to meet you. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's set.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈什和阿比盖尔在等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush and Abigail are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你有空谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, have you got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好要加入实战行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to get up from behind this desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你能随便给我个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna accidentally give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都好吗 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All good? - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能把你和他联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to tie you to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说张吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Zhang?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你和张有生意来往 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you were in business with Zhang. - Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的搭档曾经有 张投资了你的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner was. Zhang financed your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们与此无关 - 莱斯特有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had nothing to do with that. - Lester did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在张手下当过安保主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked for him. Head of security for Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你捋一捋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me set you straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是莱斯特跟他谈的生意 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lester did the business, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时候该我插上一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time for me to interject into the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们愿意出双倍的标准费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they have offered double your standard fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是五百万 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's five mil, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你喜欢这笔生意吗 - 我很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you like this? - Yes, I like it very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从报酬方面来看 我喜欢这笔生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a financial standpoint, I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么现在要追查张总\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you going after Zhang now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些黑狱背后的技术都是由张氏开发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the technology behind all of these black site prisons is Zhang's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经知道了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know that already, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,张的技术让他在监禁和折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zhang's technology has made him billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,成千上万的人上赚了数十亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}on imprisoning and torturing thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,张氏科技的创新之处就在于洗钱方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zhang Innovations is how he cleans that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他打垮 这是私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bring him down. It's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找张算账 你自己解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go after Zhang, do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对背后的情况一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had no idea what was going on behind our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经了结了 事已至此 到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead, and it's history. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在撇清关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么莱斯特·克拉克现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where is Lester Clark now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen him for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I heard…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去长途旅行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went on a long cruise…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleepy time, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 别 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no! Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,前台有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a man up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是通过国际刑警联系到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he found us through an Interpol contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他有东西你得看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claims he has something you need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把他带进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫鲍勇 我找雷·布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bao Yung. I'm looking for Ray Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,善有善报 恶有恶报\N{\fnArial\fs30}What goes around, comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷·布雷斯林 你看到这个的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Breslin, by the time you see this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经绑架了张达雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have Daya Zhang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我很快就会来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁 - 小莱斯特·克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - Lester Clark Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前合伙人的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ex-partner's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是张氏科技的安全主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was head of security at Zhang Innovations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,张达雅被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daya Zhang was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在还站这儿干嘛不去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here instead of looking for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错是谁的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not your fault, whose fault is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么地方 - 哈什 放大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's this place? - Hush, go closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:19:00.29,Title,0,0,0,0,,那个 那幅画 《狮窝中的丹尼尔》\N{\fnArial\fs30}That. That picture."Daniel in the Lions' Den."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 囚犯的守护神 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The patron saint of prisoners. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是监狱教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a prison chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 东正教 也许 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eastern Orthodox, maybe? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但写的是俄语\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the writing's in Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可能是东方集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's probably Eastern Bloc.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朱勒 去找特伦特 - 现在去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jules, get Trent. - On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱沙尼亚 塔林）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:35.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷 来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 雷 - 嘿 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Ray? - Hey, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你收到录像了吗 - 收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get the video? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did. What's going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前搭档的孩子走上不归路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ex-partner's kid went off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个地方是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think this place is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,多眼悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种地方所剩不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many of these places left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 所以你觉得是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what's your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个好地方 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad place, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,离白俄罗斯约320公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 200 miles outside of Belarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 瘦子先生 你能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mr. Skinny, can you help me out on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的吗 我只是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For free? I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来负责交通 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take care of the transportation. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天就去 欠你个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be there tomorrow. I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 哪次不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你不想呆在基地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't wanna sit this one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 让你独享所有的乐趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. Let you have all the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有哈什了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Hush back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去收拾行李 拿好装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go pack our bags, get the gear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}be back in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你说私人恩怨的时候 有多私人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said personal, how personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟达雅很亲近 我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was very close to Daya. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们走吧 神秘人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, mystery man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 别在这儿搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, don't break anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:55.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恶魔车站 拉脱维亚 德尔凡尼斯基）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲可以为我们所有人买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father can pay for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 请不要这样做 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't do this. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以好好商量商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人们老是不守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of having rules if.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那设规矩的意义又何在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}people are gonna break 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要伤害他 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please don't hurt him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-lt won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:22:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.34,0:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你干的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续走吧 - 好了 走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Continue. - All right, go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是张氏科技的安保主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were head of security for Zhang Innovations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.03,0:23:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.53,0:23:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是国际刑警 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were with Interpol, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能让这种事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 我宁愿为她付出生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've given my life to save her if I could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说这些还有什么用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,格洛克34\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glock.34,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,9毫米长管型\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine millimeter, long slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.23,0:24:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雅被带走的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they took Daya,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.41,0:24:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这把枪到底在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}where was your fancy gun then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让她失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我来了 抱歉花了点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey there. - I'm here. Sorry it took a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我也一堆事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. I got tons of stuff to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.73,0:25:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 飞机在待命了 是个长途飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, plane's waiting. It's gonna be a long flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.86,0:25:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在床上吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have breakfast in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错 阿比盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good, Abigail.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.53,0:25:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾比 - 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abby! - Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.42,0:25:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you! Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.25,0:26:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.61,0:26:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么还没打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hasn't he called yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.58,0:26:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况发展捉摸不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things can go different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.81,0:26:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你没有敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you don't have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.78,0:26:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在中国拥有第一的科技公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the number one tech company in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.79,0:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国13亿人都在用我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 1.3 billion people in China, and everyone uses my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然有敌人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.39,0:26:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为你应该从克利夫兰带些援助来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think you should bring some assistance here from Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Chicago?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想不出一个想伤害你女儿的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one you can think of that would want to harm your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.93,0:26:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它响两声再接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it ring twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.81,0:26:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,加密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.45,0:27:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以帮助我父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've helped my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.42,0:27:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你的变态技术装在他所有的黑狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put your sick technology in every one of his black site prisons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却不必因此脏手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you kept your hands clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.59,0:27:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 一切结束后 我会夺走你的金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when this is done, I'm gonna take your money,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.73,0:27:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走你的技术 我要击垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take your technology, and I'm gonna break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.84,0:27:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来我想要5亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before, I wanted $500 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要7亿美元了 而且还会继续涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I want $700 million, and it's going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.77,0:27:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们行动的资金来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what funds our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家和公司供着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paid by countries and corporations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.70,0:27:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就不用处理那些脏到极致的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take the worst of the worst off their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.81,0:28:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经杀了他们 但支票还在继续来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'd kill 'em, but the checks keep on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,连环强奸犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial rapists.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.71,0:28:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖分子 黑客 毒贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorists, hackers, narcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.95,0:28:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上的人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scum of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上到处都有像你父亲一样的人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is full of scum like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.36,0:28:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也清楚这点 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.05,0:28:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那声儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来干嘛 - 我要对她负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - She was my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.89,0:30:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一把1896年制造的电椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an electric chair that was built in 1896.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.90,0:30:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,实心橡木\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, solid oak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如苹果派一样 典型美式的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as American as apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.60,0:30:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,315人死在这张椅子上 包括三名妇女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred and 15 people died in that chair, including three women.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.55,0:30:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以前常常拿像这样的罩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to, uh… They used to put a hood like this over the.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.16,0:30:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罩住囚犯的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}inmate's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.14,0:30:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 他们会用棉花和胶带贴住眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first they would put cotton and tape over their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们被电时 不会从里面往外乱溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they didn't pop out when they fried 'em from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.12,0:30:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.79,0:30:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲创立了你的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father built your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.26,0:30:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后雷·布雷斯林夺权 把他挤了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Breslin took over, pushed him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和曾经发生的事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.62,0:30:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.65,0:30:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但你在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.22,0:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你算参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.92,0:31:28.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫济里市 白俄罗斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.56,0:31:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你这事可成不了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't do this without you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.09,0:31:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比的事我很抱歉 我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Abby. We'll set it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.65,0:31:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.50,0:31:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是罗沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Shen Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.84,0:31:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.37,0:31:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他话少\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have a lot to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.87,0:31:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识朱勒的 - 朱勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know Jules. - Hey, Jules.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鲍勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bao Yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.71,0:31:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安保人员吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Security? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.88,0:32:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前弄丢过保护目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost an asset before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.08,0:32:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.25,0:32:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不好笑 - 当然好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not funny. - Sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,张先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.76,0:32:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的事情 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about my situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道达雅被人绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that Daya was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.97,0:32:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,沈 沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen. Shen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让她活着回来的话 你就得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want her alive, do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.98,0:32:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都是为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wanted the best for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.62,0:32:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她才被人绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is why she was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.62,0:32:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen, tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.91,0:32:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万不要别接绑匪的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take the kidnapper's calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.73,0:32:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想她安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want your daughter back?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.99,0:32:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Then do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.06,0:32:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那万一激怒他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if that provokes him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.13,0:32:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是应该顺着他们的要求吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you always supposed to play to their demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.83,0:32:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间拖的越长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you delay talking to him…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会就越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the longer she lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:32:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.50,0:32:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,沈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.48,0:33:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说 这地方有多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight up, how bad is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.65,0:33:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个迷宫 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a maze, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这么令人生厌的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hellhole like I've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.76,0:33:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你撑我走了这么远 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you got me this far, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.64,0:33:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你该打的仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.87,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想退出 我理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna pull out, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.08,0:33:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我挺你 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got your back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.28,0:33:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的 我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for you. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.73,0:33:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.80,0:34:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.31,0:34:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.71,0:34:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault. Stay positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.35,0:34:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.39,0:34:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get out of this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.66,0:34:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.20,0:34:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的看什么 死筷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck you looking at, chopsticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 桑尼 把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up, Sonny. Open 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.22,0:35:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.16,0:35:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有人质中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the hostages,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有你父亲公司里最高的安全许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has the highest security clearance in your father's company?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.25,0:35:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们都是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're all geniuses,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.36,0:35:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是最聪明 最优秀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know you're all the best and the brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.26,0:35:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但敏感问题上 他最信任谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who does he trust with sensitive matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.16,0:35:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,商业机密 谁他妈的有许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trade fucking secrets. Who has the clearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.76,0:35:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.67,0:35:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.08,0:35:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗 过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这家伙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.99,0:36:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.48,0:36:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有许可吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have the clearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.27,0:36:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 不然就开枪打爆他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, or I'll shoot him in the fucking head.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.18,0:36:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.81,0:36:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.68,0:36:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 不要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.05,0:36:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会入侵公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once he has the information, he'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.74,0:36:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.64,0:36:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.61,0:37:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我张氏的机密开发项目的权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me access to Zhang's restricted developments.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.72,0:37:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们换一种方法试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Let's try this a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.79,0:37:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你教我怎么说中文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to teach me how to speak Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要教我怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna teach me how to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.79,0:37:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「告诉我 不然我照脸来一枪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tell me, or I will shoot you in the face."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.43,0:37:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用中文说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.53,0:37:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach me how to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.10,0:38:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「告诉我 不然我照脸来一枪」 用中文\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tell me, or I will shoot you in the face, " in Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.72,0:38:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.29,0:38:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个五年投射计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a five-year projection plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.82,0:38:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道所有 你需要什么 笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything. What do you need, a laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.79,0:38:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 别说「不能」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - Don't say "can't."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.46,0:38:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.50,0:38:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他找台笔记本电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get him a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈什 你有什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush, what have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.52,0:38:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在部署无人机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploying drone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他们会把人质藏在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think they're holding the hostages?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.97,0:39:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙肯定是从监狱礼拜堂打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy definitely called from the prison chapel,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.51,0:39:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.77,0:39:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有东区 西区 行政区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the east block, west block, administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.64,0:39:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这地方有多大 - 超过1万8千平方米\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How big is this place? - Over 200, 000 square feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.55,0:39:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of shells are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.12,0:39:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙息 你知道是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon's breath. You know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 计划把这个地方烧成平地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Planning on burning this place to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.19,0:39:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 如果我们幸运的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.69,0:39:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.36,0:39:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在连接无人机图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uplinking drone feed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.03,0:39:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 哈什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.54,0:39:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 看到两个牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've got two cell blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.84,0:39:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人机热能正在显示 30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the thermal drone is showing… 30…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.74,0:39:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 40 西区有40个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 40. Forty bodies in the west block.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.05,0:39:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,40什么 囚犯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}40 what, prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.14,0:39:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像 间隔均匀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it. They're spaced evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.22,0:39:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他这是一个黑狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, he's running a black site.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.82,0:39:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还有什么 警卫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What else, guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.89,0:39:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫塔 看起来有三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard tower. Looks like three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,薄弱点呢 怎么进去 快点 朱勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weak spots. What's our way in? Come on, Jules.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.89,0:40:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶上有两个热源点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two heat spots on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.56,0:40:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个盖住了 另一个可能可以突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is covered, one might be accessible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以上去 - 我不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get up there. - I don't doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.23,0:40:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.70,0:40:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能盲跑 孩子 - 我们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't run in blind, kid. - We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.87,0:40:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达雅是我负责的 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daya is my responsibility. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.94,0:40:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有朋友在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got someone in there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见过有人开跑车去打架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen anyone go to a fight in a sports car before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.59,0:40:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.93,0:40:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我更适合单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. I work better alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.96,0:40:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许会迟到一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be late…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.43,0:40:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一定不会让你们失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'll make a big impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.80,0:40:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.81,0:40:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Les.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.22,0:41:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Les, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.49,0:41:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.17,0:41:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你得坚持下去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stay the course, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你想报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you want revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.94,0:41:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们得先拿到那笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we gotta get that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.07,0:41:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.24,0:41:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他当时对我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was good to me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.51,0:41:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他现在已经不在人世了 而你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's all gone. You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.68,0:41:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得把钱搞到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.97,0:41:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后过上想过的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and live right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.98,0:41:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱他妈的能不管这贱货吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck this shit with that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.25,0:41:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.02,0:41:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这儿会让人分心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.76,0:41:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 干脆咱直接杀了她就完事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we kill her and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰基 就当是帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.17,0:41:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切按我说的做 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep doing what I say, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.94,0:41:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Les.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.94,0:41:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.61,0:42:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.83,0:42:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和莱斯的父亲之间是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with you and Les's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.63,0:42:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们曾是搭档 可他却出卖了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were his partner, and he sold you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.07,0:42:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.58,0:42:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了五百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.65,0:42:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,达雅的父亲也跟这事有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Daya's father's connected to this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.22,0:42:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是父辈的恩怨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of fathers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.00,0:42:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ray, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.06,0:42:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.77,0:42:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎浴室的戒备比较松懈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like there might be a weak spot in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.40,0:42:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴室的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.10,0:43:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接着污水处理系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sewer system.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.91,0:43:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱勒 你快看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jules, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.99,0:43:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在操作中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:07.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（污水管道系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.78,0:43:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有管道平面图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.12,0:43:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.47,0:43:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在后悔还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.11,0:43:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大可不必步入你父亲的旧尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sins of the father are not the sins of the son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.13,0:43:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有客人来访了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.66,0:43:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有客人来访了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.57,0:44:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 我们有客人来访了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.49,0:44:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,已到达恶魔车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.62,0:44:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告目前状况 - 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Status. - Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.26,0:44:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近有敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.17,0:44:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确实没人 - 检查过警卫塔没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - Check the guard towers?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.27,0:44:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查了 没有人在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.87,0:44:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.14,0:44:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事必有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.78,0:44:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 保持警惕 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay sharp, guys. Stay alert. - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.45,0:44:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 他知道我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck. He knows we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.00,0:44:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竟然知道我们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.11,0:45:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道年兽的故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You familiar with the legend of Nian?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.28,0:46:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honeypot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.72,0:46:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在拿达雅作诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using Daya as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.96,0:46:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟她之间到底有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you have with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.03,0:46:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在一起过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you together?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.03,0:46:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我们现在要做的是必须等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.00,0:46:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是集体行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a joint operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.12,0:46:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.75,0:46:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,年兽的故事是中国传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's a Chinese legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.92,0:46:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我想听听这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.26,0:46:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,古时候 有一只被称作年的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}In ancient times, there was a monster called Nian.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.00,0:46:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,每逢春天 年就会从巢穴里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every spring, Nian would come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉村民和家畜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eat the villagers and livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.11,0:46:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天 人们发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day, they discovered that…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.51,0:46:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧竹子可以把年给吓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning bamboo scared the monster off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.11,0:47:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过竹子燃烧时发出的爆炸声 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a crackling sound, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.02,0:47:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 人们发明了爆竹来模拟这种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}They invented firecrackers to re-create that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.03,0:47:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna leave you out here…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.97,0:47:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再与里面的怪兽一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}fight the monster inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.97,0:47:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭 嘭 嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pow, pow, pow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.78,0:47:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我听着 我比你更想救达雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that again. We work together for Daya.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.28,0:47:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are we waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.88,0:47:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要跟布雷斯林配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait for Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.45,0:47:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是为他干活儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.52,0:47:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿们 表演时间到了 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime, everybody. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.33,0:47:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道该做些什么 立刻行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do. Go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.82,0:48:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.02,0:48:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装完毕 随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.23,0:48:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 你要再给我捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.61,0:48:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不客\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait for Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.88,0:49:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的手拴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.12,0:49:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.19,0:49:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你保镖先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.37,0:49:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你做的事你都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did exactly what I thought you'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.32,0:49:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我找到了雷·布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led me to Ray Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.11,0:49:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还帮我抓到了他的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}helped me capture his girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.44,0:50:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.47,0:50:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅浪费了时间 还浪费了生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}you both have wasted your time and your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.61,0:50:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 你们有两个选择 要么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, you have two choices. You can either…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.67,0:50:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么老是盯着他看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you staring at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.48,0:50:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你就是在看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't. - Yeah, you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.91,0:50:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你就是在直勾勾地看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You were staring right at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.92,0:50:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩认识 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two know each other, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.02,0:51:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其中肯定有蹊跷 我能感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on here. I can sense it. I sense something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.26,0:51:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么用那种眼神看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you look at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是你从我眼中看出仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta see this through my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.60,0:51:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲在船底闷死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father died boiling at the bottom of a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.36,0:51:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果当时 你们是让他坐在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have had more respect if you sat him down in a chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.51,0:51:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他面前揭露他的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}explained what he did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.78,0:51:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一枪崩了他 我心里还会好受一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you put a bullet in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.11,0:51:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.45,0:51:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.12,0:51:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的声音够大 够清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I coming in loud and clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.86,0:51:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.93,0:51:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你将错过最精彩的环节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing all the fun here, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.13,0:51:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你仔细听着 这是为你准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep listening, buddy. This is all for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.93,0:51:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进地下通道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got in the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.31,0:51:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的女友交给我处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Breslin's girl with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.24,0:51:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 我想给你看个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ray, I want you to watch something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.32,0:51:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look at your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.71,0:55:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.49,0:56:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.83,0:56:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.85,0:57:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.61,0:58:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你还是把电话接了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I suggest you answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.68,0:58:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗沈说了不要接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shen said not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.12,0:58:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做也无济于事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.99,0:58:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.55,0:59:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸不肯接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father won't answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.09,0:59:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.42,1:01:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们闻到烟味了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, you smell that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.63,1:01:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 快闭上你们的臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Hey, shut up! Shut your fucking mouths!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.97,1:01:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.07,1:01:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 回牢房去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Move! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.58,1:02:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.36,1:02:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给老子趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.16,1:02:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 举起手来 - 快他妈的趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me your hands! - Get the fuck down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.98,1:02:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的人快趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down in front!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.51,1:02:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.67,1:02:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.71,1:03:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林到附近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin's in the near.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.46,1:03:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.43,1:03:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.83,1:03:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.27,1:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责镇压住犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.57,1:03:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈去把那用电脑的小鬼带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me that fuckin' kid on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.78,1:03:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林由我来对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.97,1:04:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.55,1:04:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,王 我们得找到王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wong. We need to find Wong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.38,1:05:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你黑进去了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hack in?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.85,1:06:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.16,1:08:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.51,1:10:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you kill her?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.88,1:10:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让她跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being with you killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.99,1:10:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is payback.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.60,1:10:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.94,1:10:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸恨死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old man hated you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.87,1:10:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你他妈的满嘴屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you're full of shit, Ray!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.24,1:10:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.11,1:10:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都没有尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't even scream.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.68,1:10:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,充其量就是咕哝了两声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda just gurgled.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.31,1:11:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做是为了你父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this for your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.94,1:11:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱你父亲吗 你爱你父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved your father? You loved your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.55,1:11:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 打我呀 替你爸打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hit me. Hit me for your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.45,1:11:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我来 我来了 动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me, you got me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.99,1:11:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的没吃饭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that a fuckin' hit?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.90,1:11:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个弱鸡 - 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fuckin' pussy. - Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.43,1:11:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你的 我来跟你说说我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fuckin' kill you. Let me tell you about my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.27,1:11:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你我爸是个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you about my fuckin' father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.27,1:11:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.34,1:12:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我告诉你我爸是个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Let me tell you about my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.35,1:12:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.18,1:12:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这个世界上最恶毒的老王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the meanest son of a bitch in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.02,1:12:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他跟我说过什么吗 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what he said? Know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.83,1:12:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他怎么说我吗 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he said? He said,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.59,1:12:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 你要学着宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You should learn to forgive, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.33,1:12:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该这么恶毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be so mean."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.03,1:12:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你说得太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "You know, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.10,1:12:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经造就了现在的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me what I am."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.82,1:12:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.99,1:12:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
