Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.84,1:15:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得沈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember Shen?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.92,1:16:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会送我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be taking me home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.06,1:16:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.60,1:16:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意啊 真的挺麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I had other plans,
