Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.74,1:16:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.98,1:17:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有件事要你去做 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's something you gotta do. - What?
